{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561240/extras/Gif1-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1742759191\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a world where justice is no longer blind, superheroes have abandoned their moral restraints and taken the law into their own hands. Welcome to <strong>Heroes Unhinged</strong>, an action roguelike game where raw power reigns supreme, and the lines between hero and villain blur into chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As one of the world's most powerful beings, you are judge, jury, and executioner. The city is your battlefield, and criminals are your prey. Tear through buildings with explosive energy blasts, hurl vehicles, and crash through entire city blocks as you hunt down the scum that plague society. No prisons. No second chances. Just brutal, unrelenting justice.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Destroy everything on the map to wipe it clean of criminal scum.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>20+ Heroes with varying play styles and abilities.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fine tune your stats with power points.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enhanced enemies have a chance to drop crystals that upgrade stats.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enemies and structures become stronger with every structure destroyed.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect crystal fragments to unlock characters and purchase items.</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3561240?t=1742759191","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561240/992500a9bf07c7112c4f2a3064d1670c36aa00fa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742759191","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561240/a63d0468